<title>INDIA: India Vardhman Spinning 96/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India Vardhman Spinning 96/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Vardhman Spinning and General Mills Ltd posted a net profit of 212.6 million rupees in 1996/97 (April-March) compared with 114.3 million in the previous year, a company statement said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;With the encouraging operational performance, the company has enhanced the dividend to 30 percent from 25 percent,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>The company's turnover increased to 3.83 billion rupees in 1996/97 against 3.35 billion in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
